            "summary": "NEW YORK (Reuters) -Starboard Value has nominated four directors, including one of its partners, to the board of BILL Holdings, said two people familiar with the matter, as the activist investor pushes the financial automation software company to improve shareholder returns.  Starboard, with an 8.5% stake in BILL Holdings, said in a regulatory filing last week that it would like to see the company unlock value for shareholders and is prepared to shake up\u00a0the board to achieve that goal.  Starboard nominated four executives who will bring expertise in financial technology, payments, operations and corporate governance, said the people, who asked not to be identified to discuss private matters.",
